WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.818
Bobby jogged through the hallway to Kids Central.

2
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.722
He was thinking about tonight's basketball practice.

3
00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:18.864
"Walk, please!"

4
00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:20.185
a voice called.

5
00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:22.127
"Hi, Ms.

6
00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.768
Folani," Bobby said.

7
00:00:24.409 --> 00:00:26.110
The principal was carrying something.

8
00:00:26.751 --> 00:00:27.512
"What's that?"

9
00:00:32.308 --> 00:00:33.809
"It's a surprise," Ms.

10
00:00:33.849 --> 00:00:35.670
Folani said as they entered the gym.

11
00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:41.193
"Miss Shelly invited me to join you at Kids Central.

12
00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:45.435
I'm going to share something I really love."

13
00:00:47.076 --> 00:00:48.457
She pulled out her yoga mat.

14
00:00:48.477 --> 00:00:52.519
"Yoga!" "My mom and dad do yoga."

15
00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:56.721
Ethan closed his eyes and touched his thumb and index fingers together.

16
00:00:56.741 --> 00:00:59.963
"Om," he chanted.

17
00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:03.692
"Yoga?" Bobby groaned.

18
00:01:03.712 --> 00:01:05.633
"That sounds boring."

19
00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:08.094
"Yeah." Jason nodded.

20
00:01:08.114 --> 00:01:10.194
"I wanted to cook something today."

21
00:01:11.374 --> 00:01:12.915
Miss Shelly frowned at the boys.

22
00:01:12.935 --> 00:01:16.676
"I'm sure we're going to have a great time.

23
00:01:17.556 --> 00:01:19.317
Please grab a mat, everybody."

24
00:01:19.337 --> 00:01:24.938
"First, we need to warm up our bodies," Ms.

25
00:01:24.978 --> 00:01:25.798
Folani said.

26
00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:31.160
"Reach your arms up to the sky like you're grabbing for clouds!"

27
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.262
Bobby saw Ethan reaching high.

28
00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:36.183
He tried to reach higher.

29
00:01:37.324 --> 00:01:40.167
"Ouch! That hurts," he said.

30
00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:44.710
"Now swing your arms from side to side.

31
00:01:44.951 --> 00:01:46.532
Like a washing machine."

32
00:01:47.352 --> 00:01:48.533
Ms. Folani showed them.

33
00:01:50.035 --> 00:01:51.816
Izzie was swinging her arms fast.

34
00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:54.318
Bobby tried to swing faster.

35
00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.921
Suddenly he toppled over.

36
00:01:57.941 --> 00:02:00.864
"That made me dizzy," he said.

37
00:02:01.908 --> 00:02:04.129
Ms. Folani had a deck of colorful cards.

38
00:02:04.149 --> 00:02:06.530
"These are yoga cards.

39
00:02:07.411 --> 00:02:08.311
You each pick one.

40
00:02:08.891 --> 00:02:11.192
Then you show us the pose on your card."

41
00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:13.293
Jason picked first.

42
00:02:14.874 --> 00:02:16.875
He looked at his card and sat on his mat.

43
00:02:17.475 --> 00:02:18.776
He lifted up his hips.

44
00:02:18.796 --> 00:02:20.516
"I'm a crab."

45
00:02:21.157 --> 00:02:23.037
He walked backward on his hands and feet.

46
00:02:23.057 --> 00:02:25.098
"Hey, this is fun!"

47
00:02:26.539 --> 00:02:27.900
Bobby tried the crab walk.

48
00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:28.620
It was fun!

49
00:02:29.948 --> 00:02:32.170
"I wish we could race though," he thought.

50
00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.511
Nina giggled at her card.

51
00:02:35.672 --> 00:02:37.013
Then she got down on the ground.

52
00:02:37.673 --> 00:02:40.435
She put her feet together and wrapped her arms around her legs.

53
00:02:41.256 --> 00:02:43.457
Next, she tucked her head between her feet.

54
00:02:43.477 --> 00:02:45.539
"I'm a turtle!"

55
00:02:45.979 --> 00:02:47.600
she called from inside her shell.

56
00:02:49.021 --> 00:02:49.902
Bobby grunted.

57
00:02:51.463 --> 00:02:53.144
He couldn't get his head between his feet.

58
00:02:54.205 --> 00:02:56.166
Izzie squealed when she saw her card.

59
00:02:56.186 --> 00:02:58.708
"I know this one!"

60
00:03:00.392 --> 00:03:02.094
She dropped onto her hands and knees.

61
00:03:02.654 --> 00:03:04.376
Then she lifted her back to the sky.

62
00:03:04.396 --> 00:03:06.918
"Meow," she called.

63
00:03:06.938 --> 00:03:08.479
"I'm a cat."

64
00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.643
"Easy!" Ethan looked at his card.

65
00:03:14.104 --> 00:03:15.805
He put his hands and feet on the floor.

66
00:03:16.686 --> 00:03:18.588
He made a triangle shape with his body.

67
00:03:18.608 --> 00:03:20.369
"Downward dog!

68
00:03:20.609 --> 00:03:21.250
Woof! Woof!"

69
00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:24.673
"I love everyone's sound effects!"

70
00:03:25.153 --> 00:03:26.234
Ms. Folani said.

71
00:03:27.335 --> 00:03:28.236
Bobby was next.

72
00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.249
His pose looked hard.

73
00:03:30.549 --> 00:03:31.690
He took a deep breath.

74
00:03:33.252 --> 00:03:34.853
He stepped his right foot forward.

75
00:03:35.474 --> 00:03:38.096
Then he stepped his left foot back and dropped to his knee.

76
00:03:38.596 --> 00:03:41.499
He reached his arms high and stuck out his tongue.

77
00:03:41.519 --> 00:03:47.684
"Rawr!" He pretended to let out a fiery dragon's breath.

78
00:03:47.704 --> 00:03:52.188
"I've always wanted a room full of dragons!"

79
00:03:52.528 --> 00:03:53.389
Miss Shelly said.

80
00:03:54.209 --> 00:03:55.591
Everyone laughed.

81
00:03:58.364 --> 00:04:01.647
"Now we all lie down and rest," Ms.

82
00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:02.467
Folani said.

83
00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.971
Bobby smiled as he closed his eyes.

84
00:04:08.732 --> 00:04:09.993
Yoga wasn't that bad.

85
00:04:10.993 --> 00:04:12.194
Maybe he would even ask Ms.

86
00:04:12.214 --> 00:04:14.096
Folani if he could borrow those cards.
